@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@nurseToken = replace-with-nurse-access-token
@patientId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@issuanceKey = patient-onboarding-example-001

### Nurse issues PATIENT only; repeat exact key/body to recover an uncertain response
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{issuanceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"patientId":"{{patientId}}"}

### Role injection must return 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/org/patient-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{nurseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{issuanceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"patientId":"{{patientId}}","role":"ADMIN"}
